{"data": [{"author_id": "19916488", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:33:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120872495054229727"], "id": "2120872495054229727", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Check out Muse, your personal AI agent. Redeem my code in Settings within 48 hours of joining and we'll both get 1 billion Muse tokens.\n\nCode: JSVYFO\nhttps://t.co/X9aBakavFB\n\n#MuseAI #MuseInviteCode #joinmuse #metamuse", "url": "https://x.com/AllFlooringNow/status/2120872495054229727"}, {"author_id": "1135576048177836033", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:29:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120871584399344039"], "id": "2120871584399344039", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120868803143929876", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\u6709\u4eba\u53d1\u5e16\u8bf4\uff0c\u5f6d\u535a\u63f4\u5f15\u77e5\u60c5\u4eba\u58eb\u79f0\uff0c\u5f20\u4e00\u9e23\u6700\u8fd1\u5728\u5b57\u8282\u5185\u90e8\u4f1a\u4e0a\u8bb2\u4e86\u4e24\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff1a\u8fd1\u7684\u662f\u672a\u6765\u6570\u5468\u8981\u63a8\u51fa\u7c7b\u4f3c Meta Muse \u7684 AI \u52a9\u624b\uff1b\u8fdc\u7684\u662f\u8981\u8ffd\u5230\u6700\u524d\u6cbf\uff0c\u6700\u65e9\u4e5f\u5f97 2029 \u751a\u81f3 2030 \u5e74\u3002\u5916\u9762\u53d1\u5e03\u4f1a\u90fd\u5728\u558a\u9a6c\u4e0a\u8d85\u8d8a\uff0c\u4ed6\u5012\u662f\u628a\u65f6\u95f4\u8868\u8bf4\u5f97\u5f88\u8001\u5b9e\u3002\n\nhttps://t.co/LKS8kiHDAD", "url": "https://x.com/MasterCui/status/2120871584399344039"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-11-12T13:27:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120870988204405007"], "id": "2120870988204405007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Quick tip: if a Meta Muse invite code