/de2pressed/status/2120860151339233283"}, {"author_id": "562604232", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:40:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120859371160903689"], "id": "2120859371160903689", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120633184098632077", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI defo hermes. i like keeping full control of my data and also the amount of websites that get blocked on meta muse/grok bot is wild. never had that issue with a local hermes", "url": "https://x.com/Hampsterman11/status/2120859371160903689"}, {"author_id": "1486336127728599052", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:40:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120859166269227093"], "id": "2120859166269227093", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1486336127728599052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 160, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120859160929542509", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "CNBC: \"For JPMorgan, Amazon, fighting AI bots like Meta Muse may not be a winning long-term strategy\" https://t.co/zdaIQR1LQE", "url": "https://x.com/billions_ntwk/status/2120859166269227093"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120859046576087040"]}, "author_id": "1486336127728599052", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:40:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120859160929542509"], "id": "2120859160929542509", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4661, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2107373361688961434", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This @CNBC article mentioned our research: \"For JPMorgan, Amazon, fighting AI bots like Meta Muse may not be a winning long-term strategy\"\n\nMost of the 51 largest US online retailers in the Billions Network audit haven't yet made a decision about AI agents, rather defaulting to https://t.co/4Hj4XAt9si https://t.co/3k1SmBleLz", "url": "https://x.com/billions_ntwk/status/2120859160929542509"}, {"author_id": "1493847647605882880", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:36:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120858332164423852"], "id": "2120858332164423852", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1493847647605882880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120858331191386454", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Meta @Muse Before Black Friday:\n1. Code, expiry and terms in live text, not an image\n2. Reply-to a monitored inbox\n3. Flag replies from Muse addresses, read what agents ask\n\nI break down email and lifecycle moves twice a day. Follow along.\n\n#EmailMarketing #LifecycleMarketing #MarketingAI", "url": "https://x.com/Suryana2291/status/2120858332164423852"}, {"author_id": "1493847647605882880", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:36:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120858331191386454"], "id": "2120858331191386454", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1493847647605882880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120858330339938753", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Meta @Muse Why this matters for lifecycle teams (my take):\n\nAn agent can only act on what it can read. If your code, expiry and exclusions sit inside a hero image, a forwarded promo gives it nothing to work with.\n\nAnd if your reply-to is noreply@, any follow-up it sends dies there.", "url": "https://x.com/Suryana2291/status/2120858331191386454"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119501556357955584"]}, "author_id": "1645834223004315648", "created_at": "2026-11-12T12:31:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120856887612633191"], "id": "2120856887612633191", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_co